    struct User {
        var clickHistory: [Int] // Product IDs
        var preferredColors: Set<Color>
        var reviewSentiment: Sentiment // Enum: Positive, Neutral, Negative
    }
    ```

*   **Review Sentiment Analysis (Function):**  Employ Natural Language Processing (NLP)  techniques (SwiftNLP library or integrate APIs like Google Cloud NLP) to extract sentiment from textual reviews and map them to the `Sentiment` enum.

    ```swift
    func analyzeSentiment(reviewText: String) -> Sentiment {
        // Utilize NLP library here (simplified example)
        if reviewText.contains("love") || reviewText.contains("excellent"):
            return .Positive
        else if reviewText.contains("average", "okay"):
            return .Neutral
